done	<str>To make the best out of a bad situation, Bea asked me to see if I could make anything out of the Wasp Stings and Feathers I gathered. I was able to use them to make some Darts. While not thrilled over the lack of Honey, Bea was happy that we at least managed to achieve something with her Bee-less Bee Farm.</str>
